{
  "family": "native-episode",
  "note": "code-health-3 CH3-20 (R3-03, R3-04, R3-08): the episode path at the steering wheel, on the manager target with the Foray tape off. Raw remote presses (the MPRemoteCommand itself, togglePlayPause among them, never through MediaMapping.intent), the deck's load deadline, grace expiry, a relinquish and a teardown, with the native n.* tokens COMPARED (compare.js NATIVE_TOKEN_FAMILIES): the session, grace, the stop cause, n.failed and the restore record. nativeOnly: the JS reference has none of these inputs, so every expect is AUTHORED from the Swift core (EngineCore through ForayEngineParity's EngineScenarioDriver, recorded from engine-parity's report) and the JVM ParitySuite is held to the same expects. Never re-recorded by record.mjs.",
  "nativeOnly": true,
